Neo Geo SDK · sound/mml/
========================

MML (Music Macro Language) source files for FM and SSG music tracks.

Files
-----

Each track file has the extension .mml and is compiled into a YM2610
sequence consumed by the Z80 sound driver via the `playMusic` /
`soundPlayGameLoop` / `playFMTrack` SDK helpers.

Layout
------

  fm/        FM channel MML (4 channels: FM1..FM4)
  ssg/       SSG channel MML (3 channels: SSG1..SSG3)
  ../mml     this directory — high-level music sequencing that
             references FM patches and SSG presets

Track ID map (sdk/sound_ids.h)
------------------------------

  SOUND_MUSIC_A = 0   /* 0_mml_example_a.mml */
  SOUND_MUSIC_B = 1   /* 1_mml_example_b.mml */
  SOUND_MUSIC_C = 2   /* 2_mml_example_c.mml */
  SOUND_MUSIC_D = 3   /* 3_mml_example_d.mml */
  SOUND_MUSIC_E = 4   /* 4_mml_example_e.mml */
  SOUND_MUSIC_F = 5   /* 5_mml_example_f.mml */
  SOUND_MUSIC_G = 6   /* 6_mml_example_g.mml */
  SOUND_MUSIC_H = 7   /* 7_mml_example_h.mml */

The indexed aliases SOUND_MUSIC_TRACK_1 .. SOUND_MUSIC_TRACK_8 map to
SOUND_MUSIC_A .. SOUND_MUSIC_H.

Build
-----

  make sound         # full audio pipeline (samples + vrom + fm + mml + ssg + m1rom)
  make mml           # only re-compile MML files

The compiled music data lands in sound/driver/music_data.inc which the
Z80 driver pulls in when assembling the M1 ROM.

Notes
-----

  - Demo chapter 03 (SOUND) uses MML-sequenced music (SOUND_MUSIC_E)
    for its intro line instead of the raw FM patch player.
  - Attract mode (games/demo/scenes/demo_title.c) loops SOUND_MUSIC_E
    for the full attract, fades out on coin-insert.
